1
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:10,829
You want these people.

2
00:00:10,829 --> 00:00:15,360
They order your products, sign up for
your services, enroll in your classes,

3
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:18,120
read your opinions,
and watch your videos.

4
00:00:18,540 --> 00:00:21,019
You'll never see them,
but they know you.

5
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:22,680
Through your website.

6
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:23,980
Or

7
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:25,560
maybe not.

8
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:29,180
Your website's visitors aren't
a faceless mass of identical mouse

9
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:34,140
clickers, but a vibrant community of
individuals with varying tastes, styles,

10
00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:37,940
and abilities.
This includes people with disabilities.

11
00:00:38,699 --> 00:00:42,690
It's important for web designers and
developers to realize that what they see

12
00:00:42,690 --> 00:00:47,950
currently on their computer, at their
resolution, with their browser and their

13
00:00:48,090 --> 00:00:51,080
operating system, is not going
to be necessarily the same thing that

14
00:00:51,080 --> 00:00:52,280
everybody else sees.

